0610: ## 7. Acceptance Criteria
0611: 
0612: ### Home Root Scroll
0613: 
0614: - Landing at `/` shows loading overlay with progress circle and logo graphic, then reveals welcome chapter with label `Welcome` and headline `irl/URL is a creative agency working in the idioms of design, brand, fashion, art and product.` plus two intro paragraphs about elevating brands and working with tastemakers.
0615: 
0616: - Scrolling proceeds through chapters `Work`, `Services`, `About`, `Mission`, `Purpose`, `Vision`, `Team`, `Contact` in order, with side labels animating from offset to settled.
0617: 
0618: - When scroll reaches bottom it wraps to top, and scrolling upward beyond top wraps to bottom, preserving infinite loop feel.
0619: 
0620: ### Header and Navigation
0621: 
0622: - Logo link showing graphic `/assets/icons.svg#logo` size `72x50` returns to first chapter when activated.
0623: 
0624: - Menu trigger toggles full-screen overlay, reports expanded state, and main content becomes invisible when overlay open.
0625: 
0626: - Navigation links `Work`, `Services`, `About`, `Team` jump to correct chapters and close overlay.
0627: 
0628: - Social links point to Instagram `https://www.instagram.com/irlurl_/`, Twitter `https://twitter.com/irlurl_` and LinkedIn `https://www.linkedin.com/company/irl-url/` and open new tab securely.
0629: 
0630: - Credit `Website by` links to `https://www.mobiquity.com` with hidden text `Mobiquity`.
0631: 
0632: ### Indicator
0633: 
0634: - Indicator shows nine dots, active dot inner fill scales horizontally with scroll progress within chapter.
0635: 
0636: - Hover over dot reveals section name label positioned near dot, clamped to avoid overflow.
0637: 
0638: - Click dot jumps to corresponding chapter.
0639: 
0640: ### Work and Case Studies
0641: 
0642: - Work chapter shows six items `MrBeast`, `Pink Palm Puff`, `Deadmau5`, `Nike x RTFKT`, `Akatsuki`, `Drew House` with uppercase descriptors on hover.
0643: 
0644: - Hover over work item triggers background preview video from `/assets/pages/` or `/assets/videos/` and descriptor appears with fade and slide.
0645: 
0646: - Click opens case overlay with close label `Close case study`.
0647: 
0648: - Cover region shows image with alt `"{Title} cover"` plus title and subtitle matching descriptor.
0649: 
0650: - Intro region shows `About the project` plus two paragraphs and `Scope` list with items split.
0651: 
0652: - Media rows contain expected local images and videos for each case, images alt `Project visual`, videos have controls muted loop.
0653: 
0654: - Closing returns to work chapter.
0655: 
0656: ### Services and Philosophy
0657: 
0658: - Services grid shows seven numbered services plus tailoring sentence.
0659: 
0660: - About shows `Working at the intersection of physical and digital.` plus large paragraph about multidisciplinary professionals and copy about opportunities.
0661: 
0662: - Mission shows `What are we here to do?` plus empowerment mission statement and copy about fashion, phygital, NFT.
0663: 
0664: - Purpose shows `Why do we exist?` plus push boundaries copy.
0665: 
0666: - Vision shows `What future do we want to create?` plus virtual and physical world copy.
0667: 
0668: ### Team and Profile
0669: 
0670: - Team chapter lists four members `Travis Anderson`, `Bree Morrison`, `Frank van Rooijen`, `Damian Estrada` with titles revealed on hover.
0671: 
0672: - Hover plays team video in background.
0673: 
0674: - Click opens profile overlay with close `Close team profile`, name heading, title subheading, exact bio text, label `Selected clients` with logo image alt containing member name, side video poster matching portrait image and autoplay muted loop.
0675: 
0676: ### Contact and Outro
0677: 
0678: - Outro shows animated figure `93x108` with slash morph animation, email `contact@irl-url.com` mailto, headquarters `Los Angeles` `USA`, operations `Hong Kong` `China`, social `Instagram`, `X`, `LinkedIn`.
0679: 
0680: ### Accessibility and Responsive
0681: 
0682: - All interactive elements reachable via keyboard, focus ring visible `2px solid currentColor` offset `4px`.
0683: 
0684: - Menu button indicates controls and expanded state, navigation overlay reports hidden when closed.
0685: 
0686: - Overlays expose close buttons with correct labels, indicator dots labeled by section name.
0687: 
0688: - No horizontal overflow at `320px`, images responsive max `100%`.
0689: 
0690: - Reduced motion preference reduces skew and looping animations, scroll instant.
0691: 
0692: ### Assets and Visuals
0693: 
